554a5994ffb41ae662bc35fa268bcf6c","session_date":"2023-06-09","session_datetime":"2023-06-09T14:31:00","session_id":"session_8","session_index":8,"source_sha256":"21cbef918400f3fb369a44c343bbce94b131afc1dc41e19e694c14a07fcbb6a9","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":7},{"dia_id":"D8:8","global_turn_index":146,"locator":"[S8T8]","raw_turn_sha256":"f0fd3d23f8e00d5e305cf6eca2d280fedbb309205a2d0d1d15007a282fa42fdf","rendered_turn_sha256":"210b48f0d2259062f7a240533af9de2a579c676d793ea6a01b186fd76d2e8da1","session_date":"2023-06-09","session_datetime":"2023-06-09T14:31:00","session_id":"session_8","session_index":8,"source_sha256":"e8f3097ec4637a66aaae7ff79451a1d261fa0b661ba510ea4100070baefc7c42","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":8},{"dia_id":"D8:9","global_turn_index":147,"locator":"[S8T9]","raw_turn_sha256":"aad31ae1d1433b028ba23fa79bdc803a666435721e426d1a6d87c7e0892187c5","rendered_turn_sha256":"4d3eda8c4b12451b48468341e1eab4ea2d422ca203b12730991da9a8fc91b90f","session_date":"2023-06-09","session_datetime":"2023-06-09T14:31:00","session_id":"session_8","session_index":8,"source_sha256":"1b6b44dd5b068a68caffd5433765651dbb4b7c033ff8b334910080ccebeb6cb0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":9},{"dia_id":"D8:10","global_turn_index":148,"locator":"[S8T10]","raw_turn_sha256":"2b7460f78b6235baba202f3808834752b5de801f2d9f0596514f4292e15ca9dd","rendered_turn_sha256":"b8d2e0abb61052d51846c52302b99b8099f1b68d279e8eba0642376becd33547","session_date":"2023-06-09","session_datetime":"2023-06-09T14:31:00","session_id":"session_8","session_index":8,"source_sha256":"756a5d32bb7945dcef724a947c689d61bacf9ce1ba76a1a8c721a882abc0c482","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":10}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together. \n[S8T1] (dia_id: D8:1)\n\nDave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\n[Image caption: a photography of a pond with a boat in it surrounded by trees]\n[S8T2] (dia_id: D8:2)\n\nCalvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?\n[Image caption: a photo of a recording studio with a large window and a desk]\n[S8T3] (dia_id: D8:3)\n\nDave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?\n[S8T4] (dia_id: D8:4)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\n[Image caption: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in the foreground]\n[S8T5] (dia_id: D8:5)\n\nDave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n[S8T6] (dia_id: D8:6)\n\nCalvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\n[Image caption: a photo of a path going up a hill with a view of the mountains]\n[S8T7] (dia_id: D8:7)\n\nDave: Nah, haven't gone hiking recently, but it's awesome - being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights. Clears your mind and brings a sense of calm. Have you been to the mountains before? Heard they're super chill.\n[S8T8] (dia_id: D8:8)\n\nCalvin: Nah, haven't been to the mountains but I'm keen to go. Looking for a way to escape it all and de-stress. I want to go on a hike to a place similar to this. What's new and exciting happening for you, Dave?\n[Image caption: a photo of a plane flying over a mountain range with snow on the top]\n[S8T9] (dia_id: D8:9)\n\nDave: I booked a trip to a mountainous region for next month! Finally gonna be able to see those majestic peaks! Gonna be an amazing experience!\n[S8T10] (dia_id: D8:10)","text_sha256":"8f5f4595af36c7b2862b83dae05b57b0dd9a4ddab06d5ce3bf775583172f45b3","timestamp":"2023-06-09T14:31:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D1:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":47,"line_start":46,"source_locators":["[S1T11]"],"text_sha256":"b933fcad816e26bb950513c0d4cdc504caacb30fff2cbdff7c4ca016e89c876e"},{"dia_ids":["D1:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":50,"line_start":49,"source_locators":["[S1T12]"],"text_sha256":"200eaf0901ae6daaac33831769c7211d87adcc8d17ec302d2d3793d583d83945"},{"dia_ids":["D1:13"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":53,"line_start":52,"source_locators":["[S1T13]"],"text_sha256":"33e8c705c2f3cd413d28700e1ec030b59b527033d4549d832ed3e841df20e43d"},{"dia_ids":["D1:14"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":56,"line_start":55,"source_locators":["[S1T14]"],"text_sha256":"349c399793bc72a5379077525846c83882e35e12ad7c330b7f7754bc4d1166cb"},{"dia_ids":["D1:15"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":59,"line_start":58,"source_locators":["[S1T15]"],"text_sha256":"59eeb2ff0f728bd888ab7b22227e8479b7367d48284d027a762b23f502516f89"},{"dia_ids":["D1:16"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":63,"line_start":61,"source_locators":["[S1T16]"],"text_sha256":"9fa516ac77a3d1018f4a30dc0275e9e0ffd3a03c9d481481ceb191722f14e2b0"},{"dia_ids":["D1:17"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":66,"line_start":65,"source_locators":["[S1T17]"],"text_sha256":"8eb0a22c0c97e165bd71bb934ae2f4fb1d207f08d1f7f2849ef523e23b896362"},{"dia_ids":["D