Calvin: I'm gonna be in Japan for a few months then off to Boston! I can't wait!\n[S1T15] (dia_id: D1:15)\n\nDave: That's great, can't wait for you to return from your trip. I've been spending lots of time at this beautiful park lately - so calming. Have you been there before?\n[Image caption: a photography of a park with a lake and a few boats]\n[S1T16] (dia_id: D1:16)\n\nCalvin: No, I've never been in that park. Looks like a chill spot. I'll definitely check it out when I'm back. Appreciate the tip!\n[S1T17] (dia_id: D1:17)\n\nDave: Cool! Enjoy your trip! Let me know if you need any more recommendations. Have fun!\n[S1T18] (dia_id: D1:18)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! If I need any help, I'll be sure to let you know. Stay safe!\n[S1T19] (dia_id: D1:19)","text_sha256":"b5a13aa21aaba8d83844ab1df24192d2bb93262c488386b70462fb67c03dda90","timestamp":"2023-03-23T11:53:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D30:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":35,"line_start":34,"source_locators":["[S30T7]"],"text_sha256":"abeb6c0647984c32928574b9f6bba9799fca53226a6a54ec4100d0139c0131a0"},{"dia_ids":["D30:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":39,"line_start":37,"source_locators":["[S30T8]"],"text_sha256":"72d3d9c8a20e22b554b8c0fe6b85b58cead9dc7de1ad97fa1c4520f544d0432f"},{"dia_ids":["D30:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":43,"line_start":41,"source_locators":["[S30T9]"],"text_sha256":"42d5115e3929b7584d8368dfda081c26afd27e15393ac23eae40139a2d9cc4e1"},{"dia_ids":["D30:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":46,"line_start":45,"source_locators":["[S30T10]"],"text_sha256":"27a6964a47fdc41d9b17c22417e6b8f75349af7466b581a4375d37ed5f946b3b"},{"dia_ids":["D30:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":49,"line_start":48,"source_locators":["[S30T11]"],"text_sha256":"d9a10d4fec5d8ad70b19de3d62d0782bf98650472f2aae7770f848ed47e66472"},{"dia_ids":["D30:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":53,"line_start":51,"source_locators":["[S30T12]