"[S30T22]","raw_turn_sha256":"5c826987cf890e773fcbc7cc96116f4da7b1ec8d9d5fabbd77949718bb579164","rendered_turn_sha256":"170ea461d92ea5f35569f0603e2d700c99ad488a6803928d79010593da6f74d2","session_date":"2023-11-17","session_datetime":"2023-11-17T10:54:00","session_id":"session_30","session_index":30,"source_sha256":"1ebd2ab1394acaebf5528c4e1e1b05b07b5595540a59cecc26fe1d2b416e86bb","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":22}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Dave: Yes, Calvin, this camera is very good, it helps me capture those special moments really clearly.\n[S30T7] (dia_id: D30:7)\n\nCalvin: Having a good camera is key for capturing those special moments. What do you like to take photos of?\n[Image caption: a photo of a sunset with a wave crashing on rocks]\n[S30T8] (dia_id: D30:8)\n\nDave: Yeah, being able to take good pics is key. I love capturing the beauty of nature - sunsets, beaches, waves. Just got this one recently, check this out!\n[Image caption: a photo of a sunset with a wave crashing on rocks]\n[S30T9] (dia_id: D30:9)\n\nCalvin: Nice job, Dave! That shot looks great! Nature's so amazing!\n[S30T10] (dia_id: D30:10)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It's incredible how much emotion and beauty nature can convey through a photo.\n[S30T11] (dia_id: D30:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, nature really does the trick. Its beauty helps us appreciate life when it's tough. Like a breath of fresh air!\n[Image caption: a photo of a pond with rocks and a waterfall in the middle]\n[S30T12] (dia_id: D30:12)\n\nDave: I totally agree, nature really can boost our spirits in tough times. Also, here's a picture I snapped last week! It's a peaceful scene with rocks and a waterfall. Pretty cool, huh?\n[Image caption: a photo of a waterfall flowing over rocks and boulders]\n[S30T13] (dia_id: D30:13)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, that picture is stunning! Where was that taken? It looks so serene!\n[S30T14] (dia_id: D30:14)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I found this serene spot in a nearby park and took this pic.\n[S30T15] (dia_id: D30:15)\n\nCalvin: Wow, that sounds like such a peaceful and serene spot. Can't wait to check it out myself sometime. Check out this beautiful picture that I shot in a Japanese garden, that's wild!\n[Image caption: a photo of a bench under a tree with pink flowers]\n[S30T16] (dia_id: D30:16)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Found an even better spot, with a bench under a tree with pink flowers - so peaceful. A perfect spot to relax and take in the beauty.\n[S30T17] (dia_id: D30:17)\n\nCalvin: That sounds great, Dave! Can't wait to see it.\n[S30T18] (dia_id: D30:18)\n\nDave: Check it out, Calvin. It's really calming, I think you'll like it. We will definitely go there! Is there anything else you'd like to share?\n[S30T19] (dia_id: D30:19)\n\nCalvin: Thank you for asking, Dave! Yes, I have a few more great news! I've accepted an invitation to perform at an upcoming show in Boston! It's going to be an unforgettable musical experience. Can't wait to fill you in on all the details. Catch up with you soon!\n[S30T20] (dia_id: D30:20)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! That's amazing news! Congratulations on both the gala attendance and the upcoming performance. I can't wait to hear all about it and maybe even catch one of your shows in Boston. Let me know when you're free to catch up. Cheers to your musical journey!\n[S30T21] (dia_id: D30:21)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I'll catch you when I'm in Boston. Cheers!\n[S30T22] (dia_id: D30:22)","text_sha256":"569416335e343575b115e5952016eacd8961a0e0c19140c16a97b3ddbd732314","timestamp":"2023-11-17T10:54:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D5:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":20,"source_locators":["[S5T3]"],"text_sha256":"a25cd32818a9be4a8398a4723f9944448d406631a9818161bf7b4c014fd2adec"},{"dia_ids":["D5:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":